WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:09,220
No, no more, Xiaodie

2
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,020
It's over. It's a real fraud.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,580
Brother, why are you retreating?

4
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,780
Are you not professional?

5
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,140
Why should I run?

6
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:20,070
I stand professionally

7
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,710
But the old man of the Liu family

8
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,600
He was choked

9
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:31,490
If you can't speak, don't move.

10
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,220
Let me use your body to convey the message

11
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,460
How dare you come?

12
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,540
You still have the nerve to come, old man?

13
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,100
Something to say

14
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:46,750
Old man, there's no point in taking action.

15
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:48,230
I'm your dad

16
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:50,490
I gave it

17
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:55,380
It's no use talking to me here. You want to file a complaint?

18
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,460
I'll find a place for you to sue you, don't tell me

19
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,260
I can't help you with your affairs.

20
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:00,180
Solve three thousand

21
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,620
Name code price, no counter-offer

22
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:03,190
You count three numbers

23
00:01:03,510 --> 00:01:04,870
I'll leave after three counts

24
00:01:05,270 --> 00:01:06,270
If you want to make a fuss, make a fuss

25
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:07,550
Let’s see who suffers in the end

26
00:01:07,910 --> 00:01:09,070
I want a breath

27
00:01:09,830 --> 00:01:11,390
I want him in front of everyone

28
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:12,870
Kowtow to me and admit your mistake

29
00:01:15,010 --> 00:01:16,410
Then you have to speak clearly

30
00:01:17,230 --> 00:01:18,190
Can't explain

31
00:01:18,190 --> 00:01:19,110
Just pretend I didn't come

32
00:01:19,110 --> 00:01:20,190
He owes hundreds of thousands in gambling money

33
00:01:20,190 --> 00:01:21,390
Come back and ask me for help but I won’t give you.

34
00:01:21,390 --> 00:01:22,790
Later, I talked to the old lady from the next village

35
00:01:22,790 --> 00:01:23,710
Play for a while

36
00:01:23,710 --> 00:01:25,030
He ran to someone's door and cursed

37
00:01:25,030 --> 00:01:27,430
What happened after someone painted my house?

38
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:28,670
He blocked me in the room

39
00:01:28,670 --> 00:01:30,390
Force me to write something with a medicine bottle

40
00:01:30,390 --> 00:01:32,990
I said that the house must be given to him in advance, but I didn’t write it.

41
00:01:32,990 --> 00:01:34,390
He pressed me on the bed

42
00:01:34,390 --> 00:01:36,310
Take medicine for me spoon by spoon

43
00:01:36,310 --> 00:01:38,590
I'm so stupid that I can't even die

44
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:40,150
The day I died

45
00:01:40,150 --> 00:01:41,310
he's at the card table

46
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:42,670
Someone calls him

47
00:01:42,670 --> 00:01:44,710
He said he would wait until he finished this fight

48
00:01:46,190 --> 00:01:47,550
Go and ask below

49
00:01:47,590 --> 00:01:49,270
Is what he said true?

50
00:01:49,270 --> 00:01:50,550
I want him to kowtow

51
00:01:50,550 --> 00:01:52,030
In front of the whole hospital
